        "nobel_worthiness": "High-energy neutrino astronomy opened a genuinely new observational channel for the Universe.",
        "attribution": "Halzen is a clear central scientific leader for IceCube and its realization.",
        "maturity": "The discovery is established through a large, sustained data set and strengthened by multimessenger observations.",
        "uncertainties": [
