        "Enrico Costa",
        "Filippo Frontera",
        "Shrinivas R. Kulkarni"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Afterglow localization transformed gamma-ray bursts from enigmatic transients into cosmological probes.",
        "attribution": "Costa and Frontera were decisive in the observational breakthrough, while Kulkarni was central to establishing the afterglow interpretation.",
        "maturity": "The result has been repeatedly confirmed and has shaped high-energy transient astronomy for decades.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The exact division of credit between satellite instrumentation, follow-up teams, and interpretation requires careful historical review."
        ]
      }
    },
